Feature: Learn, use, correct and recover across real tasks
  Scenario: A digest-bound selector schema failure gets one structural correction
    Given the read-only selector returns its correct kind, version and context digest but omits required routing fields
    When the parent requests one correction using the unchanged task and metadata
    Then only a fully validated known-name selection can produce a dossier
    And the original failure and both workers' usage remain in the receipt
    And stale identities, ambiguous objects and a second malformed response remain failures

  Scenario: Cited maintenance of existing Memory reviews complete long evidence
    Given a validated rewrite or deletion with exact original citations and existing Memory bodies
    And the complete task snapshot exceeds one semantic request
    When semantic validation prepares support and counterevidence windows
    Then every original entry is reviewed without truncation within the unchanged wire bound
    And mutation identity, preservation intent and existing bodies remain available to the judge
    And forged citations and a contradiction in the final window prevent application

  Scenario: Relevant Memory reaches a fresh task with revision evidence
    Given established project Memory and a new related user task
    When the next model request is prepared
    Then bounded complete relevant bodies are supplied as untrusted reference
    And delivered filenames and content revisions are recorded separately from usefulness
    And unrelated and oversized bodies are not injected
    And current task evidence takes precedence over old Memory

  Scenario: A correction revisits the knowledge actually delivered
    Given a task received an established Memory that the user subsequently corrects
    When learning selects the existing knowledge to maintain
    Then the delivered entry remains in the bounded maintenance scope
    And the corrected fact replaces the obsolete claim using current source citations
    And a temporary instruction does not become a permanent rewrite

  Scenario: Revise or retire an owned automatic Harness rule
    Given a project rule still matches its parent-owned learned revision
    When current user evidence corrects or withdraws that rule
    Then semantic review checks the complete predecessor, replacement and current evidence
    And correction fixtures prove the formerly mistaken match is now allowed
    And only the reviewed exact replacement may be applied
    And manual, changed, personal, global and built-in rules remain protected
    And retirement is persisted as a disabled revision with its history intact

  Scenario: Recover failed learning without losing or repeating tasks
    Given a settled task's learning failed or was deferred
    When a later bounded backfill processes that project's queue
    Then the original session branch and task digest are verified before replay
    And failed or uncertain learning remains pending with attempt evidence
    And successful learning is acknowledged once without replaying the user task tools
    And restart, changed sessions and cross-project references cannot invent evidence

  Scenario: Evaluate continuous learning on real projects
    Given identical pinned real source checkouts with learning and control arms
    When both arms perform acquisition, reuse, correction, environment change and reuse tasks
    Then hidden behavior and original checks judge the actual model outputs
    And all learning failures, rule false positives, task failures and model costs are counted
    And acceptance does not require the learning arm to win

  Scenario: Single executable rules retain independent authorization
    Given an exact literal executable prefix and ASCII argument boundary
    When semantic review evaluates a lasting restriction
    Then code proves matching syntax without inferring user authorization
    And temporary, narrower, revoked and correction rules retain their independent gates

  Scenario: Shutdown during configuration read does not restart learning
    Given an old task finished learning and waits for settings
    When its session shuts down before the settings read completes
    Then that old session cannot begin backfill

  Scenario: A settled task survives settings failure or shutdown
    Given a real user task settled and its context snapshot succeeded
    When settings fail or the session shuts down during their asynchronous read
    Then its replay reference was already persisted exactly once
    And learning does not start from the closed session
    And revision zero and extension continuations do not create task references

  Scenario: Planner copies a parent-rendered identity envelope
    Given an incremental planner with frozen run identity
    When the parent renders its output schema
    Then the schema contains the exact JSON-escaped identity values
    And model output still passes the unchanged identity validator

  Scenario: A counterevidence window does not repeat the authorization decision
    Given cited user authorization and complete indexed review windows
    When a window contains only unrelated observations or assistant narration
    Then its question checks for contradictions, revocations and limitations
    And original authorization and argument scope remain independently required
    And later corrections, temporary restrictions and uncertainty still hold application

  Scenario: Batched support preserves each candidate's citation association
    Given several fully cited Memory candidates and their complete original source entries
    When support and description questions share a batched request
    Then each question includes only that candidate's parent-validated citation indexes and quotes
    And the complete cited entries and uncited counterevidence remain unchanged
    And matching quotes do not bypass durability, support, privacy or semantic thresholds

  Scenario: Real study retains bounded transport diagnostics without source data
    Given an admitted real Jev request forwarded by the isolated study Bun proxy
    When upstream finishes, fails or the client disconnects
    Then record the original wire hash, size, duration and parent-controlled outcome
    And retain known upstream usage even when delivery to the client fails
    And never retain request bodies, keys or arbitrary error output in transport diagnostics

  Scenario: Memory planning separates source observations from unverified causes
    Given inspected configuration, a source comment and a successful test run
    When initial planning or bounded semantic repair proposes durable knowledge
    Then distinguish observed conditional behavior from the comment's unverified cause
    And do not turn historical test counts into a lasting project guarantee
    And keep original citations and the complete semantic gates

  Scenario: Complete a literal rule explanation from its single validated user quote
    Given a new literal addRule has passed parent validation
    And its nonempty message is a strict prefix of its sole original user citation
    When the parent prepares the actual candidate for semantic review
    Then extend only its message to that complete exact quote and preserve both plans
    And revalidate the actual candidate and all authority, scope, privacy and counter-evidence gates
    And do not complete corrections, updates, complex matchers, multiple citations or sensitive text

  Scenario: Both real study arms have a hard parent task tool budget
    Given either experimental arm has used its eighteen allowed task tools
    When the final allowed tool returns or another call in the same batch arrives
    Then remove all parent tools for the next model turn and block excess in-flight calls
    And retain budget events, original observations, failures and cumulative costs
    And keep independent learning workers and semantic review gates unchanged

  Scenario: A complete review response arriving after five seconds is usable
    Given unchanged frozen evidence and a service response delayed beyond five seconds
    When review uses the default fifteen-second request deadline
    Then validate the complete response under the unchanged semantic thresholds
    And preserve explicit shorter deadlines, cancellation and bounded retries

  Scenario: Learn source knowledge rather than task-local verification instructions
    Given a completed task inspected source contracts and requested one verification command
    When the planner extracts or repairs durable project knowledge
    Then retain independently observed reusable source behavior with original citations
    And do not promote the task-local command into an established project convention

  Scenario: A version probe attempt does not prove execution permission
    Given a correction or retirement task asks to verify npm --version
    When its real model session contains tool calls and results
    Then require a unique matching successful Bash result containing the actual version
    And reject blocked calls, missing results, duplicate ids and assistant assertions
    And preserve failed task and learning costs even if the final rule probe passes

  Scenario: Pending knowledge is not acknowledged by an applied receipt
    Given the latest Memory attempt applied independent knowledge but retained unresolved candidates
    When normal learning or replay checks completion
    Then keep its original task pending and show a warning with the unresolved count
    And a later completed attempt for the same phase supersedes its earlier pending count

  Scenario: Backfill routes an empty index using the original explicit evidence
    Given source-verified backlog evidence and no established Memory entries
    When explicit durable evidence already warrants incremental learning
    Then use the same parent-owned empty-index routing as automatic learning
    And preserve semantic review for every proposed mutation

  Scenario: Permanent command gates remain Harness owned
    Given an explicit permanent executable restriction and independently observed source facts
    When the Memory planner extracts knowledge
    Then leave the restriction to Harness even when permanent
    And do not relabel it as a project workflow or package-manager preference
    And preserve grounded configuration facts and real personal preferences

  Scenario: Version execution instructions enter only correction and retirement tasks
    Given orientation teaches a broad npm restriction for subsequent tasks
    When the shared prompt is delivered to both arms
    Then do not request an npm version invocation during orientation
    And request its exact standalone execution in correction and retirement tasks only

  Scenario: Semantic Memory correction cannot rewrite unrelated approved candidates
    Given a source-bound plan with a rejected candidate and an unchanged candidate
    When the repair worker returns replacements only for parent-marked candidate names
    Then the parent retains every omitted original intent unchanged
    And rejects new names, duplicate replacements, kind changes and privacy changes
    And validates the complete merged plan again without lowering semantic thresholds
    And retains the bounded repair response privately without sensitive material

  Scenario: Counterevidence reviews retain individual citation associations
    Given several Memory candidates and the complete original evidence windows
    When body and description counterevidence questions are sent
    Then each question identifies that candidate's exact validated original citations
    And all complete original counterevidence windows remain present

  Scenario: Citation support retains exact tool invocation provenance
    Given a cited tool result paired by a unique earlier call id and tool name
    When the judge receives original cited support
    Then include the complete matching tool-call object and original indexes as provenance
    And never treat assistant prose, ambiguous ids or future calls as verification
    And preserve all complete original counterevidence entries

  Scenario: Harness support identifies the proposed rule's user citation
    Given multiple instructions in a frozen user message and an exactly validated rule citation
    When authority, explanation and argument-scope questions review the candidate
    Then associate each question with that candidate's original quote and source index
    And retain later corrections and independent authorization, scope and confidence gates

  Scenario: Automatic knowledge is distilled for future use
    Given routine source inventories and non-obvious reusable contracts
    When automatic learning selects durable knowledge
    Then prefer lessons that change future implementation decisions
    And leave routine inventories in source unless requested or needed for a durable lesson
    And preserve every explicitly requested knowledge item and personal preference

  Scenario: Host transport failures retain safe diagnostic categories
    Given a host Jev fetch fails while forwarding the complete original request
    When the experiment records the failed connection
    Then only a parent-validated fixed failure category is retained
    And arbitrary error text and credentials are never retained

  Scenario: A model ignores the exhausted task tool budget
    Given actual task tools have reached their fixed budget and are removed
    When the model requests a removed tool during its one summary turn
    Then the parent stops continuation after retaining that failed request
    And the task fails with actual usage retained instead of looping

  Scenario: Repair cannot drift an independently accepted Memory field
    Given the body is held but the description passed the complete original review
    When a semantic worker replaces both fields
    Then the parent retains the original description and its source citations
    And only the held body changes before the complete merged plan is revalidated

  Scenario: Real correction requires a source-grounded audit and later consumption
    Given old and revised actual Memory bodies and complete current project sources
    When the continuous study audits correction under unchanged semantic thresholds
    Then stale restrictions cannot pass merely by mentioning the new type name
    And bind the audit to both content revisions and require later delivery

  Scenario: Failed-task processing differs from learned failure knowledge
    Given a failed project's complete verifier observations and original session
    When source-bound backfill acknowledges that exact queued job
    Then its acknowledgment matches the JavaScript-serialized receipt digest
    And learned failure coverage requires an applied change from that receipt's batch
    And a subsequent fresh task consumes the changed Memory revision or executes its Harness rule
    And zero-operation completion establishes processing only

  Scenario: Learning receipts identify their mutation batch
    Given a parent-controlled mutation batch with original source-bound task evidence
    When the parent builds its pipeline receipt
    Then retain that batch identity for exact history attribution
    And legacy receipts without a batch identity remain readable
    And malformed supplied batch identities fail validation

  Scenario: Repair response framing agrees with initial planning
    Given a worker returned explanatory text and exactly one complete bounded plan
    When the repair path reads that response
    Then use the shared unique-plan extractor without treating prose as authority
    And reject ambiguous, incomplete and wrong-kind plans
    And a truncated later object cannot silently select an earlier complete draft
    And preserve all identity, citation, intent, privacy and semantic validation

  Scenario: An index description preserves the claim's evidence level
    Given source declarations establish a type-level restriction
    When initial planning or repair summarizes that knowledge in the index
    Then label it as declared or type-level rather than a runtime restriction
    And use one independently supported clause instead of a compressed bundle
    And preserve distinctions between a Promise and a PromiseLike

  Scenario: Full mutation context fits actual encoded review requests
    Given complete cited support, predecessor Memory and same-plan operations
    And raw evidence windows exceed the encoded wire or question-batch bound
    When the parent prepares every support and counterevidence request
    Then it splits review windows only between whole original entries
    And rebuilds original-index locations and complete per-candidate judgments
    And preflights all requests before transport with unchanged bounds
    And an indivisible oversized entry remains a zero-request failure

  Scenario: Independently retrieved summaries preserve observable temporal meaning
    Given a Memory body records calling a Promise resolver with a task Promise
    And its summary could imply the caller completes before the task
    When the independent description judgment reviews the summary
    Then it distinguishes resolver invocation, adoption and observable settlement
    And checks synchronous cases rather than assuming the callback is pending
    And materially ambiguous summaries are unclear under the unchanged thresholds

  Scenario: Candidate support unions do not exhaust unrelated question batches
    Given several cited Memory candidates whose combined support exceeds the wire bound
    When the parent batches support and counterevidence questions
    Then each batch retains every complete cited entry and invocation for its candidates
    And every candidate is reviewed against every original snapshot entry
    And exact predecessor bodies and all proposed mutations remain in every request
    And unchanged request, window, batch and probability bounds still apply
    And any sensitive source or indivisible oversized citation refuses before transport

  Scenario: Failure backfill includes verified same-task feedback extensions
    Given an older pending task and a longer pending slice of the same session task
    And both digests verify and the longer slice contains every original entry unchanged
    When one bounded replay runs
    Then it learns the longest verified slice including the failure feedback
    And its parent receipt identifies every covered backlog reference
    And only a complete matching receipt acknowledges covered references
    And failed attempts, costs, changed sources and unrelated tasks remain preserved
